# Local-only scratch. Never build inputs, and the whole context crosses the
# network now that the Docker daemon is remote (docs/docker-on-theborg.md).
# Compiled Ginkgo/Go test binaries alone were 5.4 GB across 162 files; the
# `**/` prefix is required, since a bare `*.test` matches the repo root only.
.worktrees
.local-cluster
.claude/worktrees
**/*.test
